      "headline": "Network conviction eases 0.8% over 24 hours",
      "summary": "SubnetRadar showed 29.54 million alpha locked across 123 subnets, with 25.41 million perpetual and 4.13 million decaying. The dashboard recorded eight conviction events over seven days; today's visible events were below the 50,000-alpha Unlock Watch threshold. Decaying positions release continuously rather than as guaranteed one-day cliffs.",
